comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-15T09:10:03.263Z",codex-agent,"The same unchanged live-holder case passes in the complete successful Node 26.7.0 Bun retry at 4476.0 ms; the full retry passes 567/567 with unchanged 100% coverage floors. The isolated focused Node 26 run also passed 1/1. The first Node 24 Bun attempt had failed this case at 32460.2 ms; full Node 24 npm had passed it at 10715.8 ms. This remains an unresolved environment/timing-sensitive test observation, not a claimed runtime fix. No assertion, fixture or controller code was changed."
